WEBVTT

01:49.509 --> 01:54.900
[A Dream Within A Dream]

01:55.060 --> 01:58.030
[Episode 33]

01:58.080 --> 02:00.950
[Male Lead's Mansion]

03:01.410 --> 03:02.120
Nan Heng.

03:03.190 --> 03:04.000
Nan Heng.

03:08.310 --> 03:09.570
You don't have a fever.

03:09.590 --> 03:10.910
Didn't the physician say

03:10.910 --> 03:13.170
you'd be fine as long as there's no fever?

03:13.240 --> 03:14.640
Why aren't you waking up?

03:18.030 --> 03:19.710
What's gone wrong?

03:26.280 --> 03:27.810
Why are you still bleeding?

03:28.470 --> 03:30.120
Is the wound inflamed again?

03:46.079 --> 03:46.870
Nan Heng!

03:48.800 --> 03:49.590
-Your Highness.
-You're awake?

03:49.590 --> 03:50.390
You're awake?

03:51.360 --> 03:52.420
Let me check on you.

03:52.710 --> 03:54.190
Can't you read the room?

03:54.190 --> 03:55.000
Don't mind us.

03:55.000 --> 03:55.710
Carry on.

03:55.710 --> 03:56.470
What are you doing?

03:56.470 --> 03:57.000
I need to serve His Highness.

03:57.000 --> 03:58.730
-Go, go.
-Your Highness, it's me!

03:58.730 --> 03:59.680
I'm Fugui!

03:59.680 --> 04:00.630
Let me look after you,

04:00.630 --> 04:01.030
Your Highness!

04:01.030 --> 04:01.870
He doesn't need you,

04:01.870 --> 04:02.980
you idiot!

04:03.360 --> 04:04.560
Let go of me.

04:04.760 --> 04:06.160
I may press on your wound.

04:07.320 --> 04:08.580
You're finally awake!

04:12.240 --> 04:13.970
Have you been awake for a while?

04:17.680 --> 04:18.600
Why didn't you tell me

04:18.600 --> 04:20.040
when you woke up?

04:20.510 --> 04:22.810
Everyone was worried sick all night.

04:22.870 --> 04:23.870
I didn't even dare

04:23.870 --> 04:26.000
close my eyes once.

04:26.000 --> 04:27.630
I was so scared
something might happen to you!

04:27.630 --> 04:29.110
You know that?

04:29.160 --> 04:30.310
Yet you

04:30.310 --> 04:31.910
woke up and didn't say a word.

04:32.150 --> 04:33.730
What's wrong with you?

04:36.950 --> 04:37.750
Sorry.

04:37.770 --> 04:39.290
Did I hurt you?

04:42.070 --> 04:43.950
-You scared the hell out of me.
-I'm sorry.

04:43.950 --> 04:44.750
I'm sorry.

04:44.770 --> 04:45.840
I'm sorry.

04:46.210 --> 04:47.860
You think "sorry" fixes everything?

04:47.860 --> 04:49.409
You think that's enough?

04:49.450 --> 04:50.480
Okay, okay.

04:52.000 --> 04:53.170
I made you worry.

04:57.860 --> 04:59.190
Don't bite, don't bite.

05:01.830 --> 05:03.330
If you ever lie to me again,

05:03.430 --> 05:04.690
I'll bite you to death.

05:05.390 --> 05:06.190
Fine.

05:06.210 --> 05:07.270
I won't do it again.

05:09.040 --> 05:10.870
You scared the hell out of me.

05:22.000 --> 05:23.070
Just now,

05:23.830 --> 05:24.750
the two of them

05:25.480 --> 05:26.190
were…

05:26.190 --> 05:27.840
Enjoying their married life

05:27.950 --> 05:29.910
as newlyweds.

05:30.190 --> 05:32.240
So I didn't need to blame myself at all.

05:32.240 --> 05:32.870
Look,

05:33.159 --> 05:34.390
even though the wedding

05:34.390 --> 05:36.190
got interrupted by an assassin,

05:36.480 --> 05:38.920
nothing actually got delayed in the end.

05:40.000 --> 05:41.330
His Highness really is something.

05:41.330 --> 05:42.310
Wounded like that,

05:42.310 --> 05:43.710
but still full of energy.

05:45.690 --> 05:46.840
Fugui,

05:47.360 --> 05:48.560
in the coming year,

05:48.560 --> 05:50.120
we need to work hard

05:50.240 --> 05:51.720
and try to get a raise,

05:51.720 --> 05:53.240
but we still need
to be careful with spending.

05:53.240 --> 05:54.100
Why?

05:59.320 --> 06:00.530
My guess is,

06:00.570 --> 06:01.750
by this time next year,

06:01.750 --> 06:03.000
we'll be bringing a full-month gift

06:03.000 --> 06:05.560
to His Highness's baby.

06:06.280 --> 06:07.480
His Highness's baby?

06:08.750 --> 06:11.010
His Highness really doesn't waste time.

06:11.300 --> 06:13.570
Now that it's finally clicked for him,

06:13.600 --> 06:16.260
he's like a late bloomer
making up for lost time.

06:20.390 --> 06:21.160
Come.

06:21.160 --> 06:21.720
Okay.

06:21.720 --> 06:22.680
Mr. Wang, you're back.

06:22.680 --> 06:23.310
Tie it tighter.

06:23.310 --> 06:24.370
All right.

06:38.430 --> 06:39.190
Father?

06:42.940 --> 06:44.260
My good son,

06:44.280 --> 06:45.730
you're finally awake!

06:46.430 --> 06:47.240
Father.

06:50.150 --> 06:50.990
Son.

06:51.159 --> 06:52.030
Father.

06:52.870 --> 06:53.480
Father!

06:54.360 --> 06:55.070
Son,

06:55.070 --> 06:55.950
you're strong.

06:56.190 --> 06:57.750
Chop the firewood for me.

07:00.940 --> 07:01.940
Your Highness,

07:01.970 --> 07:03.610
you're finally up and about.

07:03.630 --> 07:05.440
I've been bored out of my mind

07:05.480 --> 07:06.680
these past few days.

07:06.750 --> 07:07.310
You…

07:07.920 --> 07:08.800
Slow down.

07:08.800 --> 07:09.540
Careful.

07:09.560 --> 07:10.450
It's fine.

07:22.390 --> 07:24.330
You can't even lift your arm.

07:24.950 --> 07:26.480
How are you supposed to eat?

07:29.070 --> 07:30.050
Yeah,

07:31.190 --> 07:32.560
how am I supposed to eat?

07:33.659 --> 07:34.460
Fugui.

07:35.159 --> 07:36.220
Feed His Highness.

07:36.510 --> 07:37.010
Okay.

07:37.030 --> 07:38.480
No, no, that's not necessary.

07:38.480 --> 07:39.070
Well,

07:40.270 --> 07:41.920
he's too clumsy.

07:45.560 --> 07:47.230
Your Highness, don't tell me

07:47.770 --> 07:49.590
you want me to feed you instead.

07:49.980 --> 07:51.430
No need for that.

07:52.310 --> 07:53.640
But if you're offering,

07:54.390 --> 07:55.430
I wouldn't say no.

08:00.390 --> 08:01.040
Alright.

08:02.430 --> 08:03.120
I'll do it.

08:04.360 --> 08:04.960
Thank you.

08:11.430 --> 08:11.950
Here,

08:12.240 --> 08:12.770
open your mouth.

08:12.770 --> 08:13.460
Wait.

08:16.800 --> 08:17.800
It's too hot.

08:22.840 --> 08:24.740
You want me to blow on it for you?

08:26.750 --> 08:28.510
Come on, you're like six-foot-three,

08:28.510 --> 08:30.040
and you're acting all cutesy with me?

08:30.040 --> 08:31.390
Oh, just blow on it already.

08:31.390 --> 08:33.049
It's not a big deal. I'll do it!

08:35.789 --> 08:37.320
If you blow on it,
how am I supposed to eat it?

08:37.320 --> 08:37.909
But

08:38.030 --> 08:38.960
isn't it hot?

08:38.960 --> 08:40.960
Still, I don't need you to blow on it.

08:42.590 --> 08:43.330
Fine.

08:43.960 --> 08:45.160
I'll do it. I'll do it.

08:45.380 --> 08:46.410
I'll blow on it.

08:54.630 --> 08:55.440
Happy now?

09:04.510 --> 09:05.320
Wait a moment.

09:07.200 --> 09:07.790
Go out.

09:08.600 --> 09:09.670
You guys eat.

09:11.120 --> 09:12.550
I want some pickled veggies.

09:12.550 --> 09:13.770
Go buy some for me.

09:16.790 --> 09:18.670
We already have so many pickled veggies.

09:18.670 --> 09:19.800
You want more?

09:21.200 --> 09:21.910
Well, I'm craving

09:21.910 --> 09:24.200
the ones from that shop
in the south of the city—

09:24.200 --> 09:25.460
Xu's Pickled Veggies.

09:25.910 --> 09:26.790
You've never had them.

09:26.790 --> 09:28.320
Let him go buy some so you can try too.

09:28.320 --> 09:29.550
That's too far.

09:29.550 --> 09:30.440
I'll have Zhong ride a horse over.

09:30.440 --> 09:32.200
You go. Don't send someone else.

09:32.200 --> 09:33.330
But, Your Highness,

09:33.510 --> 09:35.000
I haven't seen you for so long.

09:35.000 --> 09:36.200
We'll be seeing a lot of each other.

09:36.200 --> 09:38.060
Can't you spare this one morning?

09:38.150 --> 09:38.960
Go now!

09:40.030 --> 09:40.840
Go!

09:47.890 --> 09:49.290
Alright, Your Highness.

09:49.390 --> 09:51.960
Can you finally have some porridge now?

09:53.630 --> 09:54.560
Open your mouth.

10:00.810 --> 10:01.890
Slow down.

10:11.790 --> 10:12.620
Chief.

10:13.910 --> 10:16.070
This is Waning River Crescent's
expense report for this month.

10:16.070 --> 10:17.130
Please take a look.

10:24.390 --> 10:25.590
Go fetch Song Yimeng.

10:28.670 --> 10:29.480
Song Yimeng?

10:34.240 --> 10:35.030
You…

10:35.200 --> 10:38.130
You're putting me to work
right after we got married?

10:38.670 --> 10:39.670
Aren't newlyweds

10:41.000 --> 10:42.660
supposed to go on a honeymoon?

10:43.510 --> 10:44.640
What's a honeymoon?

10:45.030 --> 10:45.990
It's…

10:46.480 --> 10:47.880
going on a trip together.

10:48.720 --> 10:50.630
There'll be plenty of chances to travel.

10:50.630 --> 10:52.270
But you're the crown princess now.

10:52.270 --> 10:53.790
It's your duty to help the crown prince

10:53.790 --> 10:54.920
with state affairs.

10:55.790 --> 10:59.020
No one told me this was part of the deal.

10:59.120 --> 11:00.630
I kinda regret it now.

11:06.720 --> 11:08.720
My wound suddenly started hurting.

11:13.910 --> 11:15.050
I'll read it.

11:15.200 --> 11:16.670
I'll read it, okay?

11:16.840 --> 11:18.360
It's just reading.

11:19.120 --> 11:21.000
"Table river water branch…"

11:21.000 --> 11:21.910
Right to left.

11:21.060 --> 11:22.690
[Waning River Crescent's Ledger,
1st of March]

11:21.910 --> 11:22.790
Top to bottom.

11:23.030 --> 11:24.490
Don't you know how to read?

11:24.790 --> 11:25.840
I do!

11:28.390 --> 11:29.200
"Expenses."

11:29.890 --> 11:31.510
"Water tank main…"

11:32.320 --> 11:33.120
"Water tank…"

11:35.210 --> 11:36.720
"Water tank main…"

11:39.750 --> 11:40.550
Nan Heng,

11:40.840 --> 11:42.170
what's this character?

11:43.840 --> 11:44.770
"Maintenance."

11:45.870 --> 11:47.400
"Water tank maintenance."

11:48.910 --> 11:50.720
"Water tank maintenance."

11:51.550 --> 11:53.420
"Yangtze dolphins…"

11:54.120 --> 11:55.600
"Yangtze dolphins…"

11:55.600 --> 11:56.150
"Chui…"

11:56.390 --> 11:57.120
"Chui…"

11:57.550 --> 11:58.280
"Chui…"

11:58.720 --> 11:59.720
"Chui and Ben."

11:59.720 --> 12:02.080
"Daily food expenses: 20 taels."

12:02.730 --> 12:04.530
"River cleaning…"

12:05.750 --> 12:06.680
This character…

12:08.480 --> 12:09.340
Your Highness,

12:09.390 --> 12:10.600
I can't do this job.

12:11.420 --> 12:12.780
I never got the hang of

12:12.840 --> 12:14.390
semi-cursive script in school.

12:14.390 --> 12:15.360
And anyway,

12:15.790 --> 12:17.630
why do I have to read it?

12:18.720 --> 12:19.910
I feel dizzy,

12:19.910 --> 12:20.960
and my vision's blurry,

12:20.960 --> 12:22.510
which means I can't read,

12:22.510 --> 12:24.120
so you have to read it for me.

12:25.150 --> 12:26.710
Why not let him read it?

12:27.240 --> 12:28.240
Don't point at me.

12:30.000 --> 12:32.000
The one who started the trouble
has to fix it.

12:32.000 --> 12:33.770
W-Why am I dizzy?

12:33.840 --> 12:35.150
Because I got injured.

12:35.150 --> 12:35.910
Why did I get injured?

12:35.910 --> 12:37.000
Because of you.

12:37.720 --> 12:38.750
Because of me?

12:38.840 --> 12:40.700
You're just being unreasonable.

12:41.390 --> 12:43.910
It was the script rule
that made you take the hit for me.

12:43.910 --> 12:45.550
How is that my fault?

12:45.550 --> 12:46.550
Besides,

12:46.630 --> 12:48.440
if I hadn't acted fast that night

12:48.440 --> 12:49.790
and told Mr. Zhao to stop the bleeding,

12:49.790 --> 12:50.910
you'd be long gone by now.

12:50.910 --> 12:52.040
Do you realize that?

12:53.360 --> 12:54.150
Yes.

12:54.800 --> 12:56.390
But what about the next morning?

12:56.390 --> 12:57.960
The next morning,

12:58.080 --> 12:59.770
didn't you suddenly…

12:59.790 --> 13:00.760
Fine.

13:01.000 --> 13:01.870
I'll read it.

13:05.670 --> 13:06.750
I'll read it, okay?

13:08.390 --> 13:10.440
Hold on. Let him finish.

13:10.600 --> 13:11.800
What did you do to him?

13:11.840 --> 13:12.790
Nothing.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.910
What does it matter to you what she did?

13:15.910 --> 13:16.970
Why don't you go out?

13:16.970 --> 13:18.230
I'll teach her myself.

13:18.600 --> 13:20.000
No, I've got actual business

13:20.000 --> 13:21.060
to report.

13:21.150 --> 13:22.080
The Axe Gang

13:22.080 --> 13:23.550
came to mess with us again.

13:23.550 --> 13:25.200
It's just the Axe Gang.

13:25.320 --> 13:27.480
You're the Second Master
of Waning River Crescent,

13:27.480 --> 13:29.630
and you need me
to step in for something like that?

13:29.630 --> 13:30.440
Get out.

13:30.550 --> 13:31.440
Go deal with it.

13:33.750 --> 13:34.390
Get out.

13:34.600 --> 13:35.520
Go deal with it.

13:42.550 --> 13:44.320
So nosy.

13:46.960 --> 13:48.020
Continue reading.

13:48.270 --> 13:49.120
I'm telling you,

13:49.120 --> 13:50.320
I wasn't feeling you up that day.

13:50.320 --> 13:51.080
I was checking on you.

13:51.080 --> 13:52.410
Don't bring it up again.

13:58.750 --> 14:00.910
[Xu's Pickled Veggies]

14:07.600 --> 14:08.860
You got kicked out too?

14:10.030 --> 14:10.840
Have a seat.

14:11.000 --> 14:12.260
Let's drink together.

14:20.200 --> 14:21.530
Looks like His Highness

14:22.120 --> 14:23.550
cares less about us now.

14:24.750 --> 14:25.910
Cares less?

14:26.630 --> 14:28.230
He doesn't care for us at all.

14:28.440 --> 14:30.840
Song Yimeng
is the only one he cares for now.

14:31.480 --> 14:32.600
What about us?

14:32.920 --> 14:34.440
Ever since he got married,

14:34.460 --> 14:36.390
he's been head over heels in love

14:36.420 --> 14:38.450
and has long forgotten about us.

14:40.720 --> 14:42.720
I've wanted nothing
more than to support His Highness.

14:42.720 --> 14:43.550
But in the end?

14:44.200 --> 14:46.200
I've ended up in the same boat as you.

14:49.270 --> 14:49.840
However,

14:50.790 --> 14:51.840
to be honest,

14:52.550 --> 14:54.550
you haven't had it easy
these past few years.

14:54.550 --> 14:55.550
Look at you,

14:55.630 --> 14:56.960
not very bright,

14:57.480 --> 14:59.010
and always putting on airs.

14:59.190 --> 15:01.900
But your loyalty is truly rare.

15:04.510 --> 15:05.660
You're not so bad yourself.

15:05.660 --> 15:07.360
Without your help these years,

15:07.360 --> 15:09.720
His Highness wouldn't
have made a comeback

15:09.720 --> 15:11.320
and become the crown prince.

15:11.510 --> 15:12.990
I can't take credit for that.

15:12.990 --> 15:13.960
I only did all those things

15:13.960 --> 15:15.830
because Chief forced me to.

15:17.110 --> 15:19.110
I just wanted to coast through life.

15:19.670 --> 15:22.130
If I'd known we'd both end up
in the same boat,

15:22.510 --> 15:25.370
I wouldn't have wasted time
butting heads with you.

15:26.790 --> 15:27.600
You mean that?

15:29.120 --> 15:29.960
Of course.

15:31.630 --> 15:32.430
Shangguan,

15:33.200 --> 15:34.000
here's to you.

15:34.270 --> 15:35.000
In the past,

15:35.000 --> 15:36.440
I was being petty.

15:37.000 --> 15:38.130
I have to admit

15:38.360 --> 15:39.620
you're quite capable.

15:42.630 --> 15:44.100
You flatter me, Fugui.

15:44.390 --> 15:45.360
In this world,

15:45.510 --> 15:47.200
there aren't many sincere people.

15:47.200 --> 15:48.120
But you

15:48.270 --> 15:49.960
deserve to be called my friend.

15:49.960 --> 15:51.360
Here's to you.

15:52.210 --> 15:54.260
It's a great honor for someone like me

15:54.260 --> 15:56.560
to be friends with you,

15:56.670 --> 15:58.630
a famous figure in the martial world.

15:58.630 --> 15:59.840
I'm just a nobody.

15:59.840 --> 16:01.000
I never thought I'd be drinking

16:01.000 --> 16:02.790
with the Deputy General

16:02.870 --> 16:03.960
of the Xuanjia Army.

16:03.960 --> 16:04.550
Cheers!

16:04.550 --> 16:05.320
Cheers!

16:09.910 --> 16:10.670
We've been

16:10.670 --> 16:12.390
through hard times together.

16:13.660 --> 16:15.120
Why don't we become sworn brothers?

16:15.120 --> 16:16.050
Sworn brothers?

16:18.750 --> 16:19.480
Sure.

16:19.870 --> 16:21.150
Two poor souls

16:21.170 --> 16:22.230
and one pot of wine.

16:22.480 --> 16:23.270
Well,

16:25.030 --> 16:26.630
no time like the present.

16:27.190 --> 16:28.300
From this day forward,

16:28.300 --> 16:30.450
we'll call each other brothers.

16:30.630 --> 16:31.440
Cheers!

16:36.000 --> 16:36.840
I swear,

16:37.670 --> 16:38.750
from now on,

16:38.800 --> 16:40.690
your friends are my friends,

16:40.730 --> 16:41.910
and your enemies

16:42.270 --> 16:45.030
are my enemies.

16:45.150 --> 16:45.960
I swear,

16:46.080 --> 16:47.000
from this day forward,

16:47.000 --> 16:48.450
Shangguan and I

16:48.520 --> 16:49.750
will stay single forever

16:49.750 --> 16:52.610
and dedicate our lives
to protecting His Highness.

16:53.510 --> 16:54.480
What's wrong?

16:54.630 --> 16:56.150
Why do we need to stay single forever?

16:56.150 --> 16:57.150
What do you think?

16:57.240 --> 16:58.440
Look at His Highness.

16:58.480 --> 16:59.790
Ever since the wedding,

16:59.790 --> 17:01.450
he's been ignoring both of us.

17:01.840 --> 17:03.240
That's why the two of us

17:03.300 --> 17:05.849
must never be the kind of men
who abandon friends for women.

17:05.849 --> 17:07.569
Okay, fine, I get that.

17:07.599 --> 17:08.810
But don't you think "stay single forever"

17:08.810 --> 17:10.569
sounds a bit dramatic?

17:12.839 --> 17:14.339
What do you mean, Shangguan?

17:14.339 --> 17:16.599
Are you already in love with someone?

17:17.250 --> 17:18.310
No!

17:19.030 --> 17:19.829
No?

17:20.000 --> 17:20.940
Is she

17:21.030 --> 17:22.240
Miss Song Yiting?

17:22.960 --> 17:23.790
No!

17:24.240 --> 17:25.680
I knew it!

17:26.160 --> 17:28.160
No wonder Yunlong and Shanhu call her

17:28.160 --> 17:30.600
Mrs. Shangguan every time they see her.

17:30.790 --> 17:31.510
So

17:31.510 --> 17:33.400
you two are secretly engaged, aren't you?

17:33.400 --> 17:34.510
No, no, no!

17:34.510 --> 17:35.160
Fine.

17:36.510 --> 17:37.310
You

17:37.720 --> 17:38.640
and His Highness,

17:38.640 --> 17:39.600
you two,

17:40.000 --> 17:40.990
well done!

17:41.450 --> 17:43.580
Have you ever considered my feelings?

17:44.480 --> 17:45.270
Fine.

17:45.680 --> 17:47.100
From this day forward,

17:47.350 --> 17:49.680
I, Fugui, am sworn enemies
with the Songs!

17:49.750 --> 17:51.060
Drink by yourself!

17:59.030 --> 18:02.160
The magic of love spins and spins.

18:02.200 --> 18:05.350
Thinking of you
makes me burst with joy day and night.

18:05.350 --> 18:06.880
But I'm worried that

18:06.880 --> 18:08.750
love only lasts a moment…

18:09.550 --> 18:10.750
You're done washing?

18:14.740 --> 18:15.680
Father.

18:21.160 --> 18:21.960
Father.

18:23.000 --> 18:25.720
There are so many things
I've wanted to ask you today.

18:25.720 --> 18:26.480
Go ahead.

18:28.200 --> 18:29.800
During the Pingrong Battle,

18:29.880 --> 18:31.840
many soldiers
witnessed your death in battle.

18:31.840 --> 18:33.270
How come you're still alive?

18:33.270 --> 18:34.640
And if you were alive,

18:34.640 --> 18:35.960
why didn't you come back for me?

18:35.960 --> 18:37.050
Do you know that

18:37.200 --> 18:38.720
I, Rong Hua,

18:38.720 --> 18:41.720
and all the Qianyu soldiers
have been waiting for you?

18:48.300 --> 18:51.160
I knew you'd ask me
these questions sooner or later.

18:52.720 --> 18:53.550
But first,

18:54.150 --> 18:56.810
you have to understand
the logic of my character

18:56.960 --> 18:58.560
and how hard it's been for me.

19:01.240 --> 19:02.000
Father,

19:03.350 --> 19:04.280
what do you mean?

19:05.160 --> 19:06.350
Who am I?

19:06.830 --> 19:08.480
An invincible commander of Great Jing,

19:08.480 --> 19:10.830
undefeated on battlefields for decades.

19:10.830 --> 19:12.960
Everyone had high expectations of me.

19:14.000 --> 19:15.820
But I personally caused

19:16.310 --> 19:17.920
the tragedy at Pingrong.

19:18.880 --> 19:20.200
When I woke up,

19:20.220 --> 19:21.680
I truly wished I had died

19:21.680 --> 19:23.540
rather than go on living in shame.

19:25.000 --> 19:27.270
You understand how I felt, don't you?

19:29.970 --> 19:31.100
I do, Father.

19:31.720 --> 19:32.790
But the shame of defeat

19:32.790 --> 19:35.050
weighs just as heavily
on all the Qianyu soldiers.

19:35.050 --> 19:36.710
No matter what, you shouldn't

19:36.750 --> 19:39.350
have abandoned
the Qianyu Army in the capital.

19:39.680 --> 19:40.740
Do you have any idea

19:41.270 --> 19:43.240
what kind of hell we've been through?

19:43.240 --> 19:44.310
Of course I do.

19:44.550 --> 19:45.350
The truth is…

19:48.750 --> 19:50.440
I struggled with it

19:50.440 --> 19:51.820
more than you can imagine.

19:51.820 --> 19:53.060
But Guihong,

19:53.880 --> 19:55.750
under the wings of Lord Qianyu,

19:55.750 --> 19:57.820
you could never truly stand tall.

19:57.960 --> 19:59.070
Only by stepping away

19:59.070 --> 20:00.830
could I give you the space to grow.

20:00.830 --> 20:01.690
Look at you now.

20:01.750 --> 20:03.280
Aren't you doing just fine?

20:03.510 --> 20:04.370
As your father,

20:04.440 --> 20:06.680
I'm genuinely proud of you.

20:13.480 --> 20:15.080
You truly mean that, Father?

20:18.160 --> 20:19.000
Are you truly…

20:20.230 --> 20:21.550
proud of me?

20:28.260 --> 20:29.860
Creating you

20:30.750 --> 20:32.680
is what I'm most proud of in my life.

20:40.910 --> 20:42.260
In the past 20 years,

20:44.820 --> 20:47.080
you've never acknowledged me like that.

20:48.640 --> 20:50.010
It's different now.

20:51.720 --> 20:53.000
If not for you,

20:54.510 --> 20:56.640
I'd still be hesitating about coming.

20:58.710 --> 21:00.250
One day,
the two of us, father and son,

21:00.250 --> 21:01.680
will take back everything

21:01.680 --> 21:02.880
Nan Heng took from us.

21:11.350 --> 21:14.480
30 taels of this.

21:17.110 --> 21:18.270
Eggs.

21:20.240 --> 21:21.830
20 taels.

21:22.310 --> 21:22.960
Eat something.

21:22.960 --> 21:24.000
Sesame oil.

21:24.640 --> 21:25.790
Eggs.

21:26.240 --> 21:27.200
20…

21:27.200 --> 21:28.260
Have some water.

21:28.480 --> 21:29.940
Don't talk to me. Be quiet.

21:30.510 --> 21:31.440
Sugar.

21:33.200 --> 21:34.660
What was the amount again?

21:38.440 --> 21:39.500
This is your fault!

21:40.790 --> 21:42.000
I was doing just fine with the math.

21:42.000 --> 21:42.550
Then you talked,

21:42.550 --> 21:44.240
and I lost track of everything.

21:44.240 --> 21:45.550
How is this my fault?

21:47.450 --> 21:48.480
I've already told you

21:48.480 --> 21:49.790
I don't like reading Archaic Chinese,

21:49.790 --> 21:51.100
and I hate math.

21:51.120 --> 21:52.920
But you still… you still forced me

21:52.920 --> 21:54.780
to deal with your stupid ledgers.

21:54.810 --> 21:56.810
You're getting impatient already?

21:57.160 --> 21:58.070
I just wanted

21:58.070 --> 21:59.600
to spend more time with you.

21:59.920 --> 22:00.720
Besides,

22:00.720 --> 22:02.050
you're the crown princess now.

22:02.050 --> 22:03.240
Someday you'll be Empress,

22:03.240 --> 22:04.440
Mother of the Nation.

22:04.790 --> 22:05.880
I just wanted you

22:05.880 --> 22:07.680
to learn more about my world.

22:07.750 --> 22:08.880
It's not a bad thing.

22:11.590 --> 22:12.400
I quit.

22:13.070 --> 22:15.110
I don't want
to be the crown princess anymore.

22:15.110 --> 22:16.310
Find someone else.

22:16.330 --> 22:19.390
What do you mean
you don't want to be the crown princess?

22:22.200 --> 22:22.880
You've made me so upset

22:22.880 --> 22:24.740
that my wound is starting to hurt.

22:36.830 --> 22:38.290
You're not worried at all?

22:38.670 --> 22:39.480
Go on.

22:40.400 --> 22:41.400
Keep acting.

22:42.240 --> 22:43.750
I'll just watch you act.

22:50.350 --> 22:52.310
I really don’t know what to do with you.

22:52.310 --> 22:52.880
Fine.

22:53.920 --> 22:54.720
Let's call it a day

22:54.720 --> 22:55.920
if you don't want to learn anymore.

22:55.920 --> 22:57.380
We'll pick it up tomorrow.

22:57.790 --> 22:58.350
Really?

22:58.370 --> 22:58.960
Really.

22:58.960 --> 22:59.750
That's great.

22:59.750 --> 23:00.440
Thank you, Your Highness.

23:00.440 --> 23:01.640
I'm going to bed.

23:01.960 --> 23:02.590
Come back.

23:03.870 --> 23:05.480
You're just leaving me like that?

23:05.480 --> 23:06.790
I'm a patient now.

23:10.340 --> 23:11.860
I really can't move.

23:12.750 --> 23:13.550
Help me.

23:14.270 --> 23:15.920
Look at you,

23:16.230 --> 23:17.330
always acting.

23:29.000 --> 23:30.590
The blanket is not on properly.

23:30.590 --> 23:31.590
Pull it up for me.

23:41.720 --> 23:43.830
The pillow isn't comfortable either.

23:43.830 --> 23:45.110
Adjust it for me.

23:49.940 --> 23:51.150
You're just

23:51.240 --> 23:53.640
holding a grudge
because I used to bully you,

23:53.640 --> 23:54.900
so now you're finding ways

23:54.900 --> 23:56.060
to get back at me.

23:59.510 --> 24:01.360
When we're alone together,

24:01.510 --> 24:03.880
can we forget
you're a prince for a moment?

24:05.000 --> 24:07.260
Maybe it can feel
more real to me that way.

24:09.110 --> 24:10.040
What do you mean?

24:12.190 --> 24:13.480
I mean,

24:14.110 --> 24:16.480
I want this life to feel real.

24:17.790 --> 24:18.590
Well,

24:19.240 --> 24:20.600
you know,

24:21.310 --> 24:22.970
the iconic scene in the script

24:23.030 --> 24:24.270
didn't happen,

24:25.350 --> 24:27.160
and the male and female leads

24:27.350 --> 24:30.880
live happily ever after.

24:31.590 --> 24:33.200
It feels a bit unreal to me.

24:38.130 --> 24:39.860
It's because this prince here…

24:41.960 --> 24:43.790
It's all thanks to me.

24:45.430 --> 24:47.740
But if I hadn't given you intel,

24:47.790 --> 24:49.200
how could you, a fictional figure,

24:49.200 --> 24:50.600
have changed the ending?

24:52.200 --> 24:52.730
Alright.

24:53.000 --> 24:54.600
I'm just a fictional figure.

24:55.000 --> 24:55.830
But

24:56.920 --> 24:58.650
have you ever considered this:

24:59.510 --> 25:01.570
maybe you're a fictional figure too.

25:05.390 --> 25:07.650
What if the world you lived in

25:07.750 --> 25:09.000
wasn't real either,

25:09.420 --> 25:10.500
but just another

25:10.960 --> 25:13.270
scripted story someone made up?

25:18.550 --> 25:19.510
You have a point.

25:22.030 --> 25:23.480
It's possible that

25:24.270 --> 25:25.790
the modern world

25:25.960 --> 25:27.690
is also just a world in a script.

25:27.960 --> 25:29.620
Or maybe

25:29.680 --> 25:30.640
a world in a game

25:31.160 --> 25:32.270
or a dream.

25:34.070 --> 25:36.460
And the whole universe

25:36.590 --> 25:38.540
is just one giant

25:38.590 --> 25:39.850
Russian nesting doll.

25:41.960 --> 25:43.020
You get what I mean?

25:43.830 --> 25:44.640
Not really.

25:46.000 --> 25:48.260
But I think it's similar to the meaning of

25:48.480 --> 25:50.080
Zhuangzi's butterfly dream

25:50.160 --> 25:51.240
or the saying,

25:52.240 --> 25:53.700
"Nothing really exists."

25:55.550 --> 25:56.480
Anyway,

25:56.510 --> 25:57.770
no matter where we are,

25:57.830 --> 25:59.830
just don't drag me into any rat race.

26:00.510 --> 26:01.310
Rat…

26:02.000 --> 26:02.790
race?

26:04.350 --> 26:05.240
I mean,

26:06.590 --> 26:07.770
don't make me work,

26:07.830 --> 26:09.230
and don't boss me around.

26:09.590 --> 26:10.930
I don't have

26:11.000 --> 26:12.160
great ambitions.

26:12.920 --> 26:15.480
My only life philosophy is that

26:15.590 --> 26:17.710
life is about staying still.

26:17.830 --> 26:18.920
If I can lie down,

26:18.940 --> 26:20.600
there's no way I'm sitting up.

26:20.790 --> 26:22.260
I get it now.

26:22.510 --> 26:25.400
You're complaining that
I'm making you learn things.

26:25.400 --> 26:26.960
I just thought

26:26.960 --> 26:29.090
it'd help you fit into my world sooner.

26:30.960 --> 26:33.420
Why should I be the one
to fit into your world?

26:33.570 --> 26:35.100
Why can't you fit into mine?

26:36.720 --> 26:38.310
I can do that.

26:38.440 --> 26:39.400
But only if

26:39.400 --> 26:42.400
you teach me as patiently
as I've been teaching you.

26:42.830 --> 26:44.110
You said it.

26:45.920 --> 26:46.720
Come on.

26:47.000 --> 26:47.830
Let's study!

26:50.270 --> 26:51.070
Now?

26:58.160 --> 26:59.030
What's this?

27:00.440 --> 27:01.570
It looks kind of like

27:01.750 --> 27:03.030
the method of weapon forging.

27:03.030 --> 27:04.380
Not bad.

27:05.070 --> 27:06.710
Math and science are all connected.

27:06.710 --> 27:08.000
You've got a good eye.

27:08.000 --> 27:09.000
Last time,

27:09.000 --> 27:11.200
I showed you chemistry.

27:11.270 --> 27:13.280
Today I'm teaching you math.

27:13.550 --> 27:14.410
Pay attention.

27:15.110 --> 27:15.720
This

27:15.810 --> 27:17.640
is a math equation.

27:18.580 --> 27:19.920
Repeat after me.

27:19.920 --> 27:21.530
These are Arabic numerals.

27:22.440 --> 27:23.240
Four.

27:23.590 --> 27:24.310
Four.

27:24.310 --> 27:26.570
This is 35.

27:26.640 --> 27:27.440
35.

27:27.790 --> 27:28.590
This is two.

27:29.510 --> 27:30.080
Two.

27:30.160 --> 27:31.160
94.

27:32.720 --> 27:33.960
And this symbol here

27:34.070 --> 27:35.160
stands for…

27:35.160 --> 27:35.880
12.

27:39.910 --> 27:41.230
How did you know that?

27:43.400 --> 27:45.530
Chickens and rabbits in the same cage—

27:45.590 --> 27:47.270
35 heads above,

27:47.290 --> 27:48.650
94 feet below.

27:49.240 --> 27:50.000
The answer is

27:50.790 --> 27:52.120
23 chickens

27:52.240 --> 27:53.780
and 12 rabbits.

27:54.400 --> 27:56.110
The classic chicken-rabbit problem?

27:56.110 --> 27:57.910
That's how you understand this?

27:58.440 --> 27:59.590
Let me tell you how I figured it out.

27:59.590 --> 28:00.070
Enough.

28:00.070 --> 28:00.830
No need.

28:00.830 --> 28:01.680
I don't want to hear it.

28:01.680 --> 28:02.940
Not interested at all.

28:03.070 --> 28:05.130
Math is not my strength.

28:05.250 --> 28:06.380
I'm good at English.

28:06.480 --> 28:08.030
My English is amazing.

28:08.050 --> 28:09.310
There's no way

28:09.510 --> 28:11.070
you're good at English too.

28:12.400 --> 28:13.200
English?

28:13.480 --> 28:15.540
You mean the word you mentioned once—

28:15.680 --> 28:17.030
"abandon"?

28:20.720 --> 28:21.510
Oh my god.

28:22.200 --> 28:24.000
How do you remember everything?

28:24.790 --> 28:26.560
You're so clever.

28:27.160 --> 28:28.050
Yeah.

28:29.200 --> 28:30.240
Abandon.

28:32.680 --> 28:34.400
Copy it down first.

28:38.770 --> 28:40.170
What does this word mean?

28:40.680 --> 28:41.400
This word?

28:41.830 --> 28:42.890
It means "give up."

28:44.590 --> 28:45.400
Give up?

28:48.600 --> 28:49.920
So back then,

28:50.510 --> 28:52.640
you were thinking about giving up on us?

28:52.640 --> 28:54.030
What's your zodiac sign?

28:54.030 --> 28:55.430
You really hold a grudge.

28:58.240 --> 28:59.590
I don't wanna learn this.

28:59.590 --> 29:00.990
Teach me something else.

29:02.710 --> 29:03.510
Alright then.

29:03.960 --> 29:05.090
You pick something.

29:05.400 --> 29:06.860
I'll write it down for you.

29:08.900 --> 29:10.230
I want to learn how to say

29:11.960 --> 29:13.270
"everlasting love"

29:13.830 --> 29:15.430
and "unwavering devotion."

29:16.310 --> 29:17.240
Can you teach me?

29:21.240 --> 29:22.670
"Everlasting love?"

29:23.960 --> 29:25.360
"Unwavering devotion?"

29:27.270 --> 29:28.070
Ever…

29:30.910 --> 29:31.870
I remember now.

29:34.680 --> 29:37.530
"Everlasting love…"

29:37.790 --> 29:38.790
Bai…

29:42.720 --> 29:43.680
is "white."

29:44.110 --> 29:45.790
Shou…

29:48.200 --> 29:49.160
is "head."

29:49.720 --> 29:51.510
Tong…

29:51.590 --> 29:53.110
is "same."

29:53.960 --> 29:54.680
Xin…

29:54.680 --> 29:55.680
I know that one.

29:55.790 --> 29:56.590
It's "heart."

29:59.240 --> 30:01.070
When you were in school,

30:01.440 --> 30:03.660
you never
paid attention in class, did you?

30:03.660 --> 30:05.230
Who told you that?

30:06.720 --> 30:07.880
Didn't I just tell you

30:07.880 --> 30:09.470
my English is amazing?

30:10.310 --> 30:11.310
Repeat after me.

30:13.110 --> 30:13.640
White.

30:14.960 --> 30:15.510
White.

30:16.310 --> 30:16.920
Head.

30:17.160 --> 30:17.920
Head.

30:20.000 --> 30:20.510
Same.

30:21.200 --> 30:21.720
Same.

30:22.880 --> 30:23.680
Heart.

30:24.440 --> 30:25.000
Heart.

30:25.020 --> 30:25.920
Heart.

30:27.110 --> 30:27.720
Good!

30:31.440 --> 30:33.500
Now I'll read it for you all together.

30:33.590 --> 30:35.640
"White head same heart."

30:37.070 --> 30:38.140
Smooth, right?

30:40.200 --> 30:41.400
Why are you laughing?

30:41.480 --> 30:43.080
This is the American accent.

30:45.590 --> 30:47.120
Let's read it one last time.

30:47.750 --> 30:48.270
White.

30:49.350 --> 30:49.880
White.

30:50.920 --> 30:51.510
Head.

30:52.400 --> 30:53.000
Head.

30:54.350 --> 30:54.880
Same.

30:55.720 --> 30:56.590
Same.

30:57.530 --> 30:58.290
Heart.

30:59.070 --> 30:59.830
Heart.

31:01.550 --> 31:02.310
Heart.

31:02.720 --> 31:03.400
R.

31:03.510 --> 31:04.310
The "R" sound.

31:04.510 --> 31:05.200
Heart.

31:05.480 --> 31:08.350
♪ If frost etched traces of weariness ♪

31:07.000 --> 31:07.750
Repeat after me.

31:07.750 --> 31:09.150
Why are you staring at me?

31:09.940 --> 31:11.820
♪ If surging clouds hid the stars ♪

31:13.760 --> 31:16.450
♪ The gaze you once cast upon me ♪

31:17.580 --> 31:20.270
♪ Does it still remember love and hate? ♪

31:21.570 --> 31:24.160
♪ If the rising wind scatters the dust ♪

31:25.670 --> 31:27.630
♪ If every dream must be awakened ♪

31:29.670 --> 31:32.370
♪ How much of the past can we recognize? ♪

31:33.330 --> 31:36.030
♪ In a single thought lies tenderness ♪

31:39.010 --> 31:45.650
♪ Look at the vast heavens,
letting rain fall, indifferent to all ♪

31:47.140 --> 31:53.550
♪ Watch how time quietly
waits for stories to take root ♪

31:54.380 --> 32:01.370
♪ Look at the road ahead,
in the end, there will be guiding lights ♪

32:02.470 --> 32:15.560
♪ We lead remarkable lives
in this mundane world ♪

32:05.190 --> 32:08.810
[Everlasting Love]

32:16.800 --> 32:24.030
[Pure of Heart]

32:17.750 --> 32:19.350
Crown Prince Heng,

32:19.350 --> 32:21.280
since taking the position as heir,

32:21.310 --> 32:24.240
has devoted himself tirelessly
to matters of state,

32:24.350 --> 32:27.270
gradually becoming proficient
in both internal and external affairs.

32:27.270 --> 32:29.480
However, he still resides
outside the palace,

32:29.480 --> 32:31.070
which goes against protocol.

32:31.070 --> 32:32.240
Attending court daily

32:32.240 --> 32:33.750
exhausts his energy.

32:33.920 --> 32:36.550
Therefore, beside the inner palace,

32:36.680 --> 32:38.160
a new Eastern Palace shall be established

32:38.160 --> 32:39.640
to align with protocol

32:39.750 --> 32:42.210
and help him attend to
state matters better.

32:46.990 --> 32:50.910
[Righteousness and Virtue]

32:51.000 --> 32:51.790
Good.

32:52.310 --> 32:53.590
You all look spirited.

32:54.590 --> 32:55.410
Listen up,

32:55.880 --> 32:57.680
be quick and sharp later.

32:58.270 --> 32:58.750
Move!

32:59.110 --> 32:59.830
Yes!

33:14.030 --> 33:15.270
To think—me, Fugui,

33:15.550 --> 33:17.830
descended from
three generations of poor commoners,

33:17.830 --> 33:20.070
climbing step by step
from a remote mountain village

33:20.070 --> 33:22.070
to the Seventh Prince's Residence.

33:22.270 --> 33:23.310
How did I make it?

33:23.480 --> 33:24.740
Through my abilities!

33:26.030 --> 33:28.640
I thought I'd reached the peak of my life.

33:28.750 --> 33:29.720
But who'd have known?

33:29.720 --> 33:31.620
There's even a higher peak.

33:31.750 --> 33:33.920
Now I'm moving to the Eastern Palace.

33:35.680 --> 33:37.020
Jixiang,

33:37.440 --> 33:40.270
we're both servants,
but our fates are so different.

33:40.270 --> 33:41.030
Choices

33:41.110 --> 33:43.040
always matter more than hard work!

33:44.960 --> 33:47.460
[Jixiang]

33:49.640 --> 33:50.640
I'm not finished!

33:50.680 --> 33:51.480
Get back here!

33:51.960 --> 33:53.290
Are you deaf? Come back!

33:54.640 --> 33:55.160
Come on.

33:55.330 --> 33:56.330
Put it on the cart.

33:57.400 --> 33:58.270
Careful, careful.

33:58.270 --> 34:00.480
It's precious. Don't drop it.

34:00.960 --> 34:01.750
Okay.

34:04.000 --> 34:05.720
What do you need this plaque for?

34:05.720 --> 34:07.320
I'm taking it to our new home.

34:07.400 --> 34:08.440
To our new home?

34:10.239 --> 34:12.440
His Majesty will give
this mansion to someone else later,

34:12.440 --> 34:14.920
and the Crown Prince's Residence
has its own plaque.

34:14.920 --> 34:16.000
You don't understand.

34:16.000 --> 34:17.190
No one else

34:17.190 --> 34:18.389
can use this plaque.

34:18.510 --> 34:19.840
Only you can.

34:20.320 --> 34:21.590
Think about it.

34:22.330 --> 34:28.139
[Male Lead's Mansion]

34:22.800 --> 34:23.510
Zhixia, Yingqiu.

34:23.510 --> 34:23.960
Why…

34:23.960 --> 34:25.000
Get in the carriage.

34:25.000 --> 34:26.800
Why are you being so mysterious?

34:30.400 --> 34:33.650
[Male Lead's Mansion]

34:37.050 --> 34:37.630
Your Highness,

34:37.630 --> 34:38.840
everything is ready.

34:38.840 --> 34:39.880
Shall we depart?

34:43.650 --> 34:44.810
Y-Your Highness,

34:44.909 --> 34:45.739
what's wrong?

34:46.870 --> 34:49.690
The plaque actually reads
"Male Lead's Mansion."

34:49.739 --> 34:52.389
[Male Lead's Mansion]

34:50.489 --> 34:52.460
How did I never notice this before?

34:52.670 --> 34:54.440
I don't recognize this font.

34:55.920 --> 34:56.800
Male lead?

34:57.820 --> 34:58.880
Isn't that what Her Highness

34:58.880 --> 35:00.400
calls you?

35:02.110 --> 35:02.970
Your Highness,

35:03.280 --> 35:04.340
what is a male lead?

35:04.770 --> 35:06.230
Could you explain it to me?

35:06.230 --> 35:07.090
Your Highness.

35:07.510 --> 35:08.370
Your Highness!

35:09.260 --> 35:10.280
We've struck gold!

35:10.280 --> 35:11.260
Hurry, hurry!

35:13.000 --> 35:14.840
We've struck gold!

35:15.000 --> 35:16.000
We've struck gold!

35:16.000 --> 35:17.110
This is incredible!

35:17.110 --> 35:17.920
Mr. Chu!

35:18.110 --> 35:19.440
Mr. Chu!

35:20.880 --> 35:22.000
Mr. Chu,

35:22.190 --> 35:23.510
you really are something else.

35:23.510 --> 35:23.920
Yeah!

35:23.920 --> 35:25.320
How did you know there was a ginseng field

35:25.320 --> 35:26.810
behind the West Mountain?

35:26.880 --> 35:29.210
And it's all
thousand-year-old ginseng!

35:29.590 --> 35:30.260
Mr. Chu,

35:30.290 --> 35:32.350
take this. It's good for your health.

35:32.670 --> 35:33.920
Come to think of it,

35:33.920 --> 35:35.050
it's quite strange.

35:35.190 --> 35:36.590
My family has lived here for generations,

35:36.590 --> 35:37.590
but we've never heard

35:37.590 --> 35:39.790
of this land being able to grow ginseng.

35:41.080 --> 35:44.060
That's because the universe
keeps its secrets.

35:44.090 --> 35:45.360
And sometimes,

35:45.360 --> 35:47.920
it sends you the right person

35:47.920 --> 35:50.150
to clear the fog and show the way.

35:52.840 --> 35:54.170
Mr. Chu, we shall leave.

35:54.920 --> 35:55.670
Let's go.

35:55.670 --> 35:56.480
Let's go.

36:13.110 --> 36:13.920
Your Majesty,

36:14.960 --> 36:18.230
you've given my second daughter
many gifts lately.

36:18.990 --> 36:20.590
I'm deeply grateful.

36:21.800 --> 36:23.480
Does she like them?

36:23.590 --> 36:24.720
She does, very much.

36:24.960 --> 36:26.360
If it's from Your Majesty,

36:26.360 --> 36:27.880
it's bound to be the best.

36:29.230 --> 36:30.350
It's just that

36:31.150 --> 36:32.750
I noticed a pair of wild geese

36:32.770 --> 36:34.040
among the gifts.

36:36.190 --> 36:37.070
Now that

36:37.590 --> 36:39.130
Heng is married,

36:39.590 --> 36:42.440
it's time to consider Rui's marriage.

36:47.930 --> 36:50.800
I'm no longer as healthy as I used to be.

36:51.070 --> 36:52.800
Before I close my eyes for good,

36:53.030 --> 36:56.070
I hope to see both princes married.

36:58.950 --> 37:01.230
So, Your Majesty, you wish…

37:02.050 --> 37:03.870
to arrange a marriage

37:04.150 --> 37:06.550
between Yiting and the Eighteenth Prince?

37:07.070 --> 37:10.150
Don't you always
pride yourself on being fair?

37:11.480 --> 37:14.410
Now that your eldest daughter
is the crown princess,

37:14.800 --> 37:16.180
your wife

37:16.230 --> 37:18.160
must've given you quite an earful.

37:24.840 --> 37:25.990
If you ask me,

37:26.480 --> 37:27.960
why not let both your daughters

37:27.960 --> 37:29.220
marry into the palace?

37:31.230 --> 37:33.160
We'd become family in every sense.

37:34.960 --> 37:37.670
Your Majesty, don't tease me like that.

37:38.030 --> 37:41.360
Besides, Yiting is far inferior to Yimeng.

37:41.360 --> 37:42.880
My second daughter

37:43.070 --> 37:44.280
is hot-tempered and impatient,

37:44.280 --> 37:45.810
and she's got a mind of her own.

37:45.810 --> 37:46.840
S-She's not…

37:46.840 --> 37:48.190
She's not…

37:48.190 --> 37:49.590
I think she's great.

37:50.280 --> 37:51.800
She has a strong character,

37:51.800 --> 37:53.400
perfect for supporting Rui

37:53.400 --> 37:55.880
and straightening
that useless boy out a little.

37:55.880 --> 37:56.590
But

37:56.960 --> 37:58.550
Yiting doesn't have feelings

37:58.550 --> 38:00.230
for the Eighteenth Prince.

38:00.710 --> 38:01.590
I know.

38:02.190 --> 38:04.440
She's already in love with someone else.

38:04.440 --> 38:06.840
Then why did you
send the engagement geese?

38:08.550 --> 38:10.000
Rui has feelings

38:10.000 --> 38:11.440
for Miss Yiting.

38:11.590 --> 38:13.130
From the way he acts,

38:13.280 --> 38:15.030
that's not just a casual crush.

38:17.590 --> 38:18.400
But…

38:18.760 --> 38:19.510
But he…

38:19.510 --> 38:21.960
he can't just like her and marry her!

38:21.960 --> 38:22.440
I mean...

38:22.440 --> 38:24.670
he's gotta ask if she agrees first.

38:25.230 --> 38:27.030
I only have two daughters.

38:27.280 --> 38:29.510
I can't marry them both into your family!

38:29.510 --> 38:31.070
Isn't that how it should be?

38:31.190 --> 38:32.800
That's forced marriage!

38:32.800 --> 38:34.130
You're the Chancellor.

38:34.320 --> 38:36.520
Shouldn't you help me with my concerns?

38:38.440 --> 38:39.230
And also,

38:39.590 --> 38:41.030
why are you glaring at me?

38:41.030 --> 38:42.510
You also yelled at me.

38:42.800 --> 38:44.930
Are you trying to offend your emperor?

38:45.190 --> 38:46.360
I wouldn't dare.

38:49.070 --> 38:50.110
I apologize.

38:55.960 --> 38:57.560
You placed your piece there?

38:57.800 --> 38:59.170
No take-backs.

38:59.730 --> 39:01.120
I win.

39:02.960 --> 39:04.360
You're terrible at this.

39:17.160 --> 39:18.840
This tastes really good.

39:23.070 --> 39:23.590
Father.

39:24.440 --> 39:25.280
Don't you think you owe me

39:25.280 --> 39:26.960
an explanation for what happened today?

39:26.960 --> 39:28.670
Yesterday, you told me
why you didn't return to the capital,

39:28.670 --> 39:29.400
and I understand that.

39:29.400 --> 39:31.030
But how could you pretend
to have superpowers

39:31.030 --> 39:33.090
and live off trickery in the village?

39:34.520 --> 39:36.070
Watch your language, young man.

39:36.070 --> 39:37.070
Don't be so judgy.

39:38.280 --> 39:39.080
Let me ask you—

39:39.670 --> 39:41.860
did the villagers dig up real ginseng?

39:42.360 --> 39:44.760
And was that ginseng
already in the ground?

39:45.840 --> 39:47.710
Lying about things that don't exist—

39:47.710 --> 39:48.670
that's a scam.

39:49.800 --> 39:51.510
But I'm seriously

39:51.550 --> 39:53.400
helping the villagers get rich.

39:56.280 --> 39:56.840
But

39:57.630 --> 39:59.890
how did you know there was ginseng there?

40:00.060 --> 40:02.350
With a feather fan in hand

40:02.440 --> 40:03.590
and a quick divination,

40:03.590 --> 40:04.870
I reveal the future…

40:05.480 --> 40:07.010
with the power of prophecy.

40:09.590 --> 40:11.230
If you really had the power of prophecy,

40:11.230 --> 40:13.630
how would we have lost
the Pingrong Battle?

40:14.450 --> 40:15.510
Hey,

40:15.590 --> 40:17.800
do you have to keep bringing up
the Pingrong Battle?

40:17.800 --> 40:19.110
It's been so long.

40:19.550 --> 40:20.810
It's time you let it go.

40:21.670 --> 40:22.480
Let it go?

40:24.230 --> 40:25.030
Father,

40:25.510 --> 40:26.380
you've changed.

40:26.380 --> 40:28.030
The man you used to be
would never have let go of

40:28.030 --> 40:29.800
the 20,000 Qianyu soldiers we lost,

40:29.800 --> 40:32.730
nor would he believe in
such supernatural nonsense.

40:47.510 --> 40:48.110
Son,

40:49.000 --> 40:50.330
have you ever heard that

40:50.400 --> 40:51.820
people can awaken certain gifts

40:51.820 --> 40:53.290
on the brink of death?

40:55.030 --> 40:56.230
Take me, for example.

40:56.400 --> 40:58.800
I awakened the gift of prophecy.

40:59.110 --> 41:00.280
If it hadn't been for saving you,

41:00.280 --> 41:01.550
why would I have come here in advance,

41:01.550 --> 41:02.880
befriended the villagers,

41:02.880 --> 41:05.190
and helped you out during your escape?

41:09.570 --> 41:10.890
So you knew in advance

41:11.360 --> 41:12.480
that I'd flee here?

41:12.550 --> 41:13.230
Yes.

41:14.070 --> 41:15.590
Not just that. I also know

41:15.880 --> 41:17.710
you were rejected by the Song family,

41:17.710 --> 41:19.640
that Song Yimeng fell for Nan Heng,

41:19.710 --> 41:21.230
that His Majesty no longer trusts you,

41:21.230 --> 41:23.400
and that Nan Rui
has given up on the throne.

41:23.400 --> 41:24.800
Now you're isolated,

41:24.800 --> 41:26.190
and you feel like no one in this world

41:26.190 --> 41:27.730
can understand what you're going through.

41:27.730 --> 41:28.440
Am I right?

41:32.000 --> 41:33.730
You really do know everything?

41:34.370 --> 41:36.030
You've been watching over me
this whole time?

41:36.030 --> 41:37.000
Of course I have.

41:37.510 --> 41:38.920
You're my son.

41:39.670 --> 41:41.150
Now that we've reunited,

41:41.150 --> 41:42.440
you're not alone anymore.

41:42.440 --> 41:43.590
As for the assassination,

41:43.590 --> 41:46.440
I sent Physician Zhao
ahead of time to save Nan Heng

41:46.510 --> 41:48.570
so they'd spare you from punishment.

41:48.800 --> 41:49.590
Also,

41:49.740 --> 41:51.490
I sent letters to Rong Hua

41:51.520 --> 41:52.850
and Nan Rui yesterday.

41:53.280 --> 41:54.070
From now on,

41:54.440 --> 41:56.440
you'll have nothing to worry about.

41:58.590 --> 42:00.920
Father, you've really done so much for me.

42:04.000 --> 42:04.840
I'm sorry.

42:05.880 --> 42:06.670
I failed to carry out

42:06.670 --> 42:09.200
the responsibilities
you entrusted me with.

42:09.590 --> 42:11.190
I've let you down.

42:13.550 --> 42:14.960
As long as you trust me,

42:14.960 --> 42:16.280
nothing else matters.

42:18.590 --> 42:19.440
Guihong,

42:19.510 --> 42:22.170
His Majesty seems
to have turned his back on you,

42:22.410 --> 42:24.070
but once something happens to him,

42:24.070 --> 42:25.300
that will be our chance

42:25.300 --> 42:27.200
to make a comeback.

42:29.440 --> 42:31.280
Something will happen to His Majesty?

42:31.280 --> 42:32.070
Father,

42:32.390 --> 42:34.130
do you know something?

42:35.920 --> 42:37.730
Some secrets cannot be revealed.

42:37.730 --> 42:38.630
Son,

42:39.100 --> 42:40.700
just wait for the good news.
